      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="HS00048772X_0154"/>Herrn <hi rend="latintype">Gustav Schwarzkopf</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb207296">
                     <hi rend="latintype">I. Tiefer Graben 23</hi>
                  </rs>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="image">
            <seg rend="center">
               <pb facs="HS00048772X_0153"/>
               <hi rend="pre-print">
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb364399">München – Lukaskirche</rs>.</hi>
            </seg>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <p>
               <pb facs="HS00048772X_0153"/>Herzlichen Gruß! Dank für Ihren <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04424-1"/>Brief<note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04424-1">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-briefe" target="L04292"/>.</note>. Die
               Radtour fällt natürlich aus (Hochwaſſer <hi rend="latintype">etc.</hi>) aber das
               übrige iſt in Ordnung.– Wahrſcheinlich fahr ich dann <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04424-2"/>nach <rs type="place" ref="#pmb146">Frankfurt</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04424-2">
                  <ref type="wienerschnitzler" subtype="Cf" target="1899-09-19"/>.</note> zu <rs type="person" ref="#pmb11485">Goldmann</rs>.
                  <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04424-3"/>
               <date>Heute</date> ſeh ich mir die
                  <rs type="event" ref="#pmb209099">
                  <rs type="work" ref="#pmb30219">Vermächtnis</rs>première</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04424-3">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-kultur" target="pmb209099"/>.</note>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1"/>
               <hi rend="latintype">incognito</hi> von der <rs type="place" ref="#pmb11" subtype="implied">Gallerie</rs> an. – <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04424-4"/>
               <date>Geſtern</date> die  <rs type="event" ref="#pmb209098" subtype="implied">
                  <rs type="work" ref="#pmb32562" subtype="implied">3 Einakter</rs>
               </rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04424-4">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-kultur" target="pmb32562" subtype="See"/>.</note>, amuſirte mich ſehr  gut.</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
